{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1454434-my-only-quibble-with-the-contagion-chronicle","id":1454434,"title":"My only quibble with the Contagion Chronicle","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-07T02:09:29-07:00","id":1454434,"title":"My only quibble with the Contagion Chronicle","content":"My only quibble with the Contagion Chronicle are...Sworn Experiences. Primarily because there isn't enough to spend it on, let's say I run a game and have 4 people from the Cryptocracy as players. After 10 Sworn XP....there are no more vectors for them to buy and the entire batch of xp becomes rather superfluous","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-07T06:18:50-07:00","id":1454446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caedus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1454434-my-only-quibble-with-the-contagion-chronicle#post1454434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My only quibble with the Contagion Chronicle are...Sworn Experiences. Primarily because there isn't enough to spend it on, let's say I run a game and have 4 people from the Cryptocracy as players. After 10 Sworn XP....there are no more vectors for them to buy and the entire batch of xp becomes rather superfluous</div> </div> </div> </div>Ten Sworn Experiences is fifty Sworn Beats \u2014 which you only get from dealing with the Contagion \u2014 and this particular problem only exists if all your players are in the same faction. That's easily ten sessions's worth of activity, and even a modicum of differentiation in preferred approach at least doubles that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-08T01:36:02-07:00","id":1454508,"title":"","content":"I think that is an easy enough fix. Allow the characters to use Sworn XP on Merits that represent contacts in their conspiracy or abilities and advantages picked up by dealing with the Contagion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}